# Ads & consent

## Hold (2026-11-05)
- **No new ads** until the site has meaningful traffic. No formal deadline — Paul decides when.
- Ship with `ads.enabled` / `ads_enabled` **false** on this site until Paul lifts the hold.
- Do not add AdSense (or other network) snippets, and do not publish a live `ads.txt`, while the hold is on.


## Before any new ad network goes live
1. `ads.txt` present at site root and correct.
2. Consent / CMP banner live (Google CMP or equivalent).
3. Privacy page accurate for ads + analytics.
4. Config flag flipped on **only after** 1–3.

## Placement (when eventually on)
- Render through `views/partials/ads.php` (consent via `consent.php`).
- Cap slots per page (site config `max_slots`).
- Full-screen map / active game board pages may force ads off.
- Skip age-gated / play-money sections when the network forbids them.
